---
import "../styles.css";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" /><meta name="description" content="CodeWorksLabs demonstrations for Discourse products and theme components." /><title>Discourse Demos — CodeWorksLabs</title></head>
  <body>
    <header><a href="https://codeworkslabs.dev/">CWL / LABS</a><div class="header-navs"><nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="https://codeworkslabs.dev/products/">Products</a><a href="https://codeworkslabs.dev/platforms/">Platforms</a><a href="https://demo.codeworkslabs.dev/">Demos</a><a href="https://docs.codeworkslabs.dev/">Docs</a></nav><nav class="utility-navigation" aria-label="Help and community"><a href="https://codeworkslabs.dev/blog/">Blog</a><a href="https://codeworkslabs.dev/support/">Support</a><a href="https://forum.codeworkslabs.dev/">Forum ↗</a></nav></div></header>
    <main><section class="hero"><p>PLATFORM / DISCOURSE</p><h1>Community interfaces,<br /><em>shown in context.</em></h1><span>CodeWorksLabs and independently operated products are presented separately, with ownership and demonstration boundaries kept explicit.</span></section><div class="demo-list"><section class="demo-card"><div><p>BRAND NAVIGATION / LIVE EXTERNAL REFERENCE</p><h2>Brand Navigation</h2><p>Brand Navigation is maintained by CodeWorksLabs. The Bridge uses it in a real publishing environment, providing a live, in-context reference—not a CodeWorksLabs-owned test environment.</p><div class="actions"><a href="https://bridge.demo.discussionbridge.dev/">Open the live reference ↗</a><a href="https://codeworkslabs.dev/products/brand-navigation/">Product overview</a><a href="https://docs.codeworkslabs.dev/brand-navigation/">Documentation</a></div></div><aside><span>Product owner</span><strong>CodeWorksLabs</strong><span>Reference environment</span><strong>The Bridge</strong><span>Environment owner</span><strong>DiscussionBridge</strong><span>What this demonstrates</span><strong>Brand Navigation working on a public Discourse forum. It is a real-world example, not a controlled test of every feature.</strong></aside></section><section class="demo-card discussionbridge"><div><p>DISCUSSIONBRIDGE / INDEPENDENT PRODUCT ECOSYSTEM</p><h2>DiscussionBridge</h2><p>DiscussionBridge is the original worked example for the CodeWorksLabs product lifecycle. Its independently operated ecosystem carries the product, documentation, demonstrations, support, release evidence, diagnostics, maintenance, and recovery work established for it.</p><div class="actions"><a href="https://discussionbridge.dev/">Visit DiscussionBridge ↗</a><a href="https://demo.discussionbridge.dev/">Explore live demos</a><a href="https://docs.discussionbridge.dev/versions-and-live-status/">Versions and live status</a></div></div><aside><span>Product owner</span><strong>DiscussionBridge</strong><span>Lifecycle role</span><strong>Original worked example</strong><span>Demonstrations</span><strong>Independent DiscussionBridge demo collection</strong><span>Documentation</span><strong>Canonical status and operational evidence remain in DiscussionBridge docs.</strong></aside></section></div><section class="promise"><span>DEMO STANDARD</span><h2>A live URL is not enough.</h2><p>Every promoted demo identifies its owner, product ref, platform build, test context, and the behaviors actually verified.</p></section></main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>

<style>header nav,.header-navs{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem}.utility-navigation{gap:.55rem}.utility-navigation a{padding:.42rem .62rem;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--cyan)}.utility-navigation a:last-child{border-color:rgba(255,107,87,.55);color:var(--coral)}.demo-list{display:grid;gap:2rem}.demo-list .demo-card{margin-bottom:0}.demo-list .discussionbridge{margin-bottom:7rem}.discussionbridge>div>p:first-child{color:var(--coral)}@media(max-width:760px){header{gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.header-navs{width:100%;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem}.header-navs nav:first-child{width:100%;gap:.75rem;justify-content:space-between}.utility-navigation{gap:.55rem}.demo-list .discussionbridge{margin-bottom:5rem}}</style>
